Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, dnsutils | bind9-dnsutils, dialog | whiptail
Description: WHOIS-style RDAP and optional DNS hosting audit utility
 Display domain registration and expiry dates, nameservers, IP ownership,
 and optional network, email and authoritative DNS audits. Interactive dialog
 mode is included using dialog or whiptail.
